        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9024/102, Milan 4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern, high design are what this Milan 4 Inch Cabinet Handle is all about. Its stylish look is accentuated by the contemporary finishes in which it is available. The 4 Inch Milan Cabinet Door Pull offers a sleek look and high-quality, solid brass construction--making it a great choice for your kitchen remodel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9024\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-6-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-8-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-10-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-12-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/milan-18-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9024-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9024 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sold Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
